flowchart TB
  subgraph entry[任务入口]
    direction LR
    desktop[Desktop 与 typed IPC]
    timer[本地定时任务]
    channel[渠道消息]
    desktop ~~~ timer ~~~ channel
  end
  admission[Application 与 RunSupervisor<br/>持久接纳、Session FIFO、资源管理]
  entry --> admission
  subgraph harness[Eidos Harness]
    direction TB
    subgraph request[请求准备]
      direction LR
      memory[长期记忆<br/>短索引、主题笔记、撤销]
      context[上下文构建与压缩<br/>预算、快照、连续证据]
      model[Model Gateway<br/>固定配置、协议路由、重试]
      memory --> context --> model
    end
    loop[Durable Agent Loop<br/>Run、Step、ModelAttempt]
    subgraph action[任务执行能力]
      direction LR
      tools[Tool Runtime<br/>参数、Intent、执行、核验]
      agents[Plan 与子 Agent<br/>任务依赖、消息、结果]
      extensions[Skill、Plugin、MCP、Hook<br/>发现、信任、固定版本]
      tools ~~~ agents ~~~ extensions
    end
    subgraph bounds[工作边界]
      direction LR
      permission[权限与 Sandbox<br/>审批、Grant、Seatbelt]
      workspace[Workspace 与检索<br/>Worktree、索引、Checkpoint]
      permission ~~~ workspace
    end
    request --> loop --> action
    action -.受边界约束.-> bounds
  end
  admission --> harness
  harness --> db[(SQLite<br/>业务状态、快照、Event、Outbox)]
  db --> recovery[恢复、取消与关闭<br/>按持久事实重新接纳]
  db --> delivery[事件投递与 Desktop Feed]
  db -.诊断证据.-> quality[日志、Trace、评测与发布验证]
